      "raw": "[quote=\"Rymdkejsaren, post:1, topic:30671\"]\nSo for the first example, that must mean that you **have** to push 3, whether you like it or not?\n[/quote]\nYes, unless it says \"You may Push 3 :Dahan:,\" in which case you can push 0 or 3.\n\n[quote=\"Rymdkejsaren, post:1, topic:30671\"]\nSecond, I assume based on the *do as much as you can* principle that I can still target a land that has *fewer* than 3 Dahan with that power?\n[/quote]\nYes, unless the effect said, \"If there are at least 3 :Dahan: in target land, Push them.\"",
